  "worked_solution": "To find the area, we compute the corresponding definite integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{c}^{d}x(y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-{y}^{5}+1)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{0}^{1}{y}^{5}\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-{\\frac{{y}^{6}}{6}|}_{0}^{1}+y{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-(\\frac{1}{6}-0)+(1-0) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{6}+1 \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
